<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βακχ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>celebrate the mysteries of Bacchus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.79
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>speak</i> or <i>act like one frenzy-stricken,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				136
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1204
			</span></i>, etc.: also of places, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. στέγη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1243
			</span></i>(lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			causal, <i>inspire with frenzy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὗταί σε βακχεύουσι συγγενῆ φόνον;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					411
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				966
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Or.</u>
				835
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοσοφία εὖ μάλα βεβακχ.</span>”
				<i>full of mysticism,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.580c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>initiate in the Bacchic mysteries,</i> in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				792
			</span></i> (Cyme, <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
